## 4. How All Three Connect — End to End

```
Raw historical prices (data_fetcher)
        |
        v
Analysis module: MA, returns, volatility  ---->  Charts on dashboard
        |
        v
Prediction module: features -> model -> direction + confidence  ---->  Prediction panel on dashboard
        
Portfolio module: your trades + live prices -> P&L  ---->  Portfolio panel on dashboard
```

Analysis feeds Prediction. Portfolio is independent of both, and only needs live prices. All three land on the same dashboard as separate panels — they inform each other visually (you, the human, connect the dots), but the code stays decoupled so a bug in the prediction model can never corrupt your portfolio numbers.
